# Services

## orchestrator
Creates sweeps and assigns shards.

## sweeper
Consumes shard assignments and crawls domains.

## daemon
Schedules and processes recrawls.

## matrix
Indexes candidates by vertical, geo, and tech.

## coordinator
Tracks sweeper nodes and ingests metrics.